sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SPA as Angular SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Kafka as Kafka Event Bus
    participant PCM as Price Calculation Module
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant QM as Query Module

    User->>SPA: Change base rate for hotel/dates
    SPA->>GW: POST /api/prices/change
    Note over GW: Validate JWT, check authorization
    GW->>GW: Generate tracking ID (UUID)
    GW->>Kafka: Publish to "price-change-commands" (with tracking ID)
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 202 Accepted + tracking ID
    SPA-->>User: "Price change submitted (ID: xxx)"

    Note over SPA: Start polling status endpoint
    SPA->>GW: GET /api/prices/change/xxx/status
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 200 { status: "processing" }

    Note over Kafka,PCM: Asynchronous processing
    PCM->>Kafka: Consume from "price-change-commands"
    PCM->>PCM: Execute Rate Calculation Engine (HPS-5 rules)
    PCM->>DB: Update write_model schema (same transaction)
    PCM->>Kafka: Publish to "price-change-events" (with tracking ID)

    Note over QM,DB: Read model update
    QM->>Kafka: Consume from "price-change-events"
    QM->>DB: Refresh materialized view in read_model schema
    QM->>QM: Update status: "complete"

    Note over SPA: Polling detects completion
    SPA->>GW: GET /api/prices/change/xxx/status
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 200 { status: "complete" }
    SPA-->>User: "Price change complete"